]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years. In 2025 that pair hit 28% of normal on the middle of the grids, and in 2026 it came in at 25%. Grid 22929 had its driest year in 1956 at 48% of normal, and grid 23229 did too.</p>"}
